  "description": "Unlabelled triangular-prism wire model and its parallel wall projection: six model plus six image junctions, two triangular loops and three joins in each, not a cube. Anonymous junction anchor ink is contained within connected wire junctions, with no distinct dot or label. Paired wire contours are modern clean strokes preserving the source thickness role. Screen coordinates use the chosen affine map (x,y) to (1.2x+305,y), not source metric measurements; crossings create no additional vertices.",
  "source": {
    "image": {"path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/9-10g/figures/fig-40.png", "sha256": "81e0533f9970ea0b8a2fa101d98d2274756c37734a7a35dd596fb338e7b9428d"},
    "authoritativeText": [
      {"lesson": "geo910-c1-s1-n12", "text": "§12. 图形的平行投影. 平行投影的性质"},
      {"lesson": "geo910-c1-s1-n12", "text": "图形的平行射影这一概念，来自对阳光下纸板或铁丝模型投在墙上影子的观察（图 40 和 41）。\n由于太阳距离地球十分遥远，可以近似地把太阳光线看作平行的。"},
      {"lesson": "geo910-c1-s1-n12", "text": "本节和下一节将介绍立体几何绘图所用的法则。\n先引入几个新概念。"},
      {"lesson": "geo910-c1-s1-n12", "text": "已知平面 $\\alpha$ 和与 $\\alpha$ 相交的直线 $l$（图 39）。\n任取一点 $A_1$，过它作直线 $l_1$ 与直线 $l$ 平行。\n直线 $l_1$ 与 $\\alpha$ 交于点 $A$（图 39）。\n\n这样得到的点 $A$，叫作平行于直线 $l$ 投影时，点 $A_1$ 在平面 $\\alpha$ 上的射影，简单地说，点 $A$ 是点 $A_1$ 的平行射影。\n已知图形 $\\phi_1$ 的所有点的平行投影组成的集合 $\\phi$，叫作图形 $\\phi_1$ 的平行射影。"},
      {"lesson": "geo910-c1-s1-n12", "text": "图　39"},
      {"lesson": "geo910-c1-s1-n12", "text": "图　40"}
    ],
